-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 2, §2.8 גננת מסייעת
-- The assisting kindergarten teacher: her unit of work, her duties, her
-- training and enrichment, and the education allowance.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `2.8 גננת מסייעת`

DECLARE `2.8 party` IS ONE OF
    `a takanon party` HAS `who` IS A Party

DECLARE `assisting-teacher action` IS ONE OF
    `perform an assisting duty` HAS `assisting duty` IS AN `assisting duty`
    `complete training in the programmes` HAS `before starting work` IS A BOOLEAN
    `provide personal and professional enrichment`

DECLARE `assisting duty` IS ONE OF
    `strengthen the individual child in a small group`
    `run varied activities: talk, play, outings, systematic study, puppet theatre, art materials`
    `teach basic concepts in every field, structured and unstructured`
    `plan with the teacher programmes for single children or small groups, and report their progress`

§§ `2.8.1 Unit of work`

@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_1/p1
`weekly hours in an assisting teacher's unit` MEANS 30

-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_1/p2 The heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_1/p3 A source: special director-general's circular, copy 24, of 21.7.85.

§§ `2.8.3 Duties`

-- ¶1: "these are the assisting teacher's duties", 1-4; each is hers to do.
@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_3/p1
GIVEN d IS AN `assisting duty`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `2.8 party` `assisting-teacher action`
DECIDE `performing an assisting duty` d IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `perform an assisting duty` x PROVIDED x EQUALS d
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "2.8.3: a duty of the assisting kindergarten teacher"

`the assisting teacher's duties` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_3__para_1
        `strengthen the individual child in a small group`,
        @ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_3__para_2
        `run varied activities: talk, play, outings, systematic study, puppet theatre, art materials`,
        @ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_3__para_3
        `teach basic concepts in every field, structured and unstructured`,
        @ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_3__para_4
        `plan with the teacher programmes for single children or small groups, and report their progress`

-- 5: every assisting teacher completes training in the programmes to be run,
-- before starting work and while working with children. Time in school
-- months from her start.
@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_3__para_5
GIVETH A DEONTIC `2.8 party` `assisting-teacher action`
DECIDE `training before and during the work` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `complete training in the programmes` before PROVIDED before
    WITHIN 0
    HENCE (PARTY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee`
           MUST  `complete training in the programmes` during PROVIDED NOT during
           LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "2.8.3.5: training continues during the work with children")
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "2.8.3.5: training before starting work"

@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_3__para_6
GIVETH A DEONTIC `2.8 party` `assisting-teacher action`
DECIDE `enrichment by the supervisor` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the supervisor`
    MUST  `provide personal and professional enrichment`
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the supervisor` BECAUSE "2.8.3.6: the supervisor sees to the assisting teacher's enrichment"

-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_3/p2 The heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_3/p3 A source: summary of a discussion between the pedagogical secretariat and the Teachers' Union of 1.6.86.

§§ `2.8.6 Education allowance`

-- F-2.8-a: section 1.12, to which ¶2 refers, excepts assisting kindergarten
-- teachers from this allowance; this section's own words are encoded.
@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_6/p1
`an assisting teacher is entitled to the education allowance under 2.8.6` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_8__ssec_2_8_6/p2
@desc The education allowance of section 1.12 for the employee's salary; an input until section 1.12 is imported
ASSUME `the education allowance of section 1.12` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER

-- The posts section 1.12 (¶33 of its rows) prints as excepted from the
-- class-education allowance, quoted here as the finding's evidence only.
DECLARE `kindergarten post` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten teacher entitled to the coordination allowance`
    `assisting kindergarten teacher`
    `integration kindergarten teacher`
    `other kindergarten teacher`

`the kindergarten posts section 1.12 excepts, as printed` MEANS
    LIST `kindergarten teacher entitled to the coordination allowance`,
         `assisting kindergarten teacher`,
         `integration kindergarten teacher`

`2.8.6 grants what section 1.12 excepts` MEANS
        `an assisting teacher is entitled to the education allowance under 2.8.6`
    AND elem `assisting kindergarten teacher` `the kindergarten posts section 1.12 excepts, as printed`
#ASSERT `2.8.6 grants what section 1.12 excepts`

-- Worked examples.
#ASSERT count `the assisting teacher's duties` EQUALS 4
#TRACE `training before and during the work` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee` DOES `complete training in the programmes` TRUE AT 0
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee` DOES `complete training in the programmes` FALSE AT 3
